 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Talk about employment",
   "texto": [
    "**Ansatt** is «employee»; **leder**, «responsable» or «Chief». **Arbeidstid** is the working hours and **lønn**, the salary.",
    "One day can be **heltid** (full-time) or **deltid** (part-time). **Dagvakt** is the day shift; **nattevakt** is the night shift."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Tasks and responsibility",
   "texto": [
    "**Arbeidsoppgave** means work. **Ansvar for** states that someone takes care of something: **Hun har ansvar for gjestene** («She's responsible for the guests.»). **Tar imot** means receiving or welcoming."
   ]
  },
